{"seq":1,"slug":"noise-error-characterization","title":"噪声模型与错误表征方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/error-correction-fault-tolerance/noise-error-characterization","wordCount":3121,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"噪声模型与错误表征方法\">噪声模型与错误表征方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量子计算与经典计算的第一个工程分野，不在比特数量，而在<strong>错误必须先被建模、才能被纠正</strong>。经典芯片的位翻转离散且罕见，一个概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 就能概括；量子比特的错误是连续的、相关的、随操作历史演化的——一次双比特门不仅可能翻转控制比特，还会通过串扰把相位噪声泄漏到相邻比特上。纠错码要工作，先得有人告诉它「错误长什么样」。这套「把物理噪声压缩成可计算对象」的工序，就是<strong>噪声模型</strong>（noise model）与<strong>错误表征</strong>（error characterization）。</p>\n<p>它解决三个层次的问题：<strong>表征</strong>回答「当前这台机器的错误有多大、什么形状」；<strong>建模</strong>把测量结果写成信道或生成元（generator）形式，供模拟器与解码器消费；<strong>验证</strong>保证模型在真实电路体量下仍成立、且没把相干误差误当随机噪声抹平。任一环节失真，都会让下游的容错阈值计算变成空中楼阁。核心权衡始终是「保真度 vs 可扩展性」——层析（tomography）在 2–3 个比特上就指数爆炸，能上 100+ 比特的方法必然是稀疏、局部化的近似；而量子比特的错误不会自己变小，只会随比特数增长而变得更相关。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[物理量子处理器] --&gt; B[表征协议&lt;br/&gt;RB / GST / XEB / Pauli 学习]&#10;    B --&gt; C{建模层次}&#10;    C --&gt;|白噪声近似| D[去极化信道&lt;br/&gt;单参数 p]&#10;    C --&gt;|含 T1/T2| E[热弛豫信道&lt;br/&gt;振幅+相位阻尼]&#10;    C --&gt;|含相关噪声| F[稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad&lt;br/&gt;生成元 + 串扰]&#10;    D --&gt; G[模拟器 / 解码器噪声模型]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[表面码阈值与逻辑错误率预测]&#10;    H --&gt; I{预测 vs 实测逻辑错误率}&#10;    I --&gt;|吻合| J[模型可信, 可用于码设计]&#10;    I --&gt;|偏离| K[回炉: 检查相干误差与泄漏]&#10;    K --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[物理量子处理器] --&gt; B[表征协议&lt;br/&gt;RB / GST / XEB / Pauli 学习]\n    B --&gt; C{建模层次}\n    C --&gt;|白噪声近似| D[去极化信道&lt;br/&gt;单参数 p]\n    C --&gt;|含 T1/T2| E[热弛豫信道&lt;br/&gt;振幅+相位阻尼]\n    C --&gt;|含相关噪声| F[稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad&lt;br/&gt;生成元 + 串扰]\n    D --&gt; G[模拟器 / 解码器噪声模型]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[表面码阈值与逻辑错误率预测]\n    H --&gt; I{预测 vs 实测逻辑错误率}\n    I --&gt;|吻合| J[模型可信, 可用于码设计]\n    I --&gt;|偏离| K[回炉: 检查相干误差与泄漏]\n    K --&gt; B</pre><p>下表对比三类噪声模型在工程上的取舍，这张表也解释了为什么 2026 年的主流做法是「分层建模」而非追求单一精确模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型类型</th>\n<th>参数数量级</th>\n<th>能捕捉什么</th>\n<th>无法捕捉什么</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去极化（depolarizing）</td>\n<td>1 个概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>/门</td>\n<td>平均随机错误强度</td>\n<td>所有相干性、方向偏好、T1</td>\n<td>快速估算阈值、教学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热弛豫（thermal relaxation）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、门时长、热布居</td>\n<td>振幅阻尼、相位阻尼、态依赖</td>\n<td>串扰、非马尔可夫记忆效应</td>\n<td>含时门序列模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>比特数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>耦合数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{比特数} \\times \\text{耦合数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">耦合数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个率</td>\n<td>相关噪声、串扰、可逆性</td>\n<td>泄漏、强非马尔可夫过程</td>\n<td>PEC 误差缓解、解码器先验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>建模工具侧的代表实现：Qiskit Aer 的 <code>NoiseModel</code> 同时支持 <code>depolarizing_error</code>、<code>thermal_relaxation_error</code>、<code>kraus_error</code> 三类构造子，并可通过 <code>NoiseModel.from_backend</code> 从真实后端属性直接生成（来源：Qiskit Aer 官方教程，qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer，0.17.x，Apache-2.0）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"噪声的物理来源与数学表征\">噪声的物理来源与数学表征</h2><p>噪声模型的第一层是物理来源的拆解。能量弛豫来自介质损耗、准粒子隧穿与辐射泄漏，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表征；退相位来自磁通噪声、电荷噪声与临界电流涨落，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表征。两者共同构成单比特的马尔可夫主方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d\\rho}{dt} = -\\frac{i}{\\hbar}[H,\\rho] + \\gamma_1 \\mathcal{D}[\\sigma_-]\\rho + \\gamma_\\phi \\mathcal{D}[\\sigma_z]\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0225em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}[L]\\rho = L\\rho L^\\dagger - \\frac{1}{2}\\{L^\\dagger L, \\rho\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">†</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1941em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">†</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Lindblad 耗散子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_1 = 1/T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_\\phi = 1/T_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。方程给出的是<strong>连续时间</strong>噪声，而量子电路是<strong>离散门序列</strong>，工程上要把它「采样」成每个门之后的信道——热弛豫信道即由此而来：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、门时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 得到门后 CPTP 映射，这正是 Qiskit Aer 里 <code>thermal_relaxation_error(T1, T2, gate_time)</code> 的物理含义（约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2 \\le 2T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 自动成立）。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>信道表示</strong>。任何马尔可夫噪声都能写成 Kraus 算符和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>↦</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>†</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\mapsto \\sum_k E_k \\rho E_k^\\dagger</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7054em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">†</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而量子比特上最方便的错误基是 Pauli 基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{I, X, Y, Z\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的直积。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 比特错误信道在 Pauli 基下展开为<strong>泡利转移矩阵</strong>（Pauli transfer matrix, PTM）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span>，其非对角元就编码了相干误差——去极化模型把所有非对角元强制归零，这正是它「抹平相干性」的根本原因。</p>\n<p>工程上最常引用的是<strong>去极化近似</strong>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 施加均匀的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X/Y/Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 错误。它流行的原因是单参数、易解析计算阈值，且是许多解码器的天然假设；代价是真实器件的方向偏好与相干成分被抹平，长电路上会系统性低估逻辑错误率。</p>\n<p>第三层是<strong>泄漏</strong>（leakage）——态跑出计算子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|0\\rangle, |1\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣0</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣1</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|2\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 及以上能级。泄漏不能写成两能级 Pauli 信道，且会在比特间传播，是 2026 年超导工程里被反复强调的「表征盲区」，只能用泄漏 RB 或交叉熵基准的三态分析检出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏-pauli-lindblad-学习与串扰\">稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad 学习与串扰</h2><p>如果只用去极化或热弛豫模型，一处关键信息会整个丢掉：<strong>噪声是相关的</strong>。同一次双比特门操作会在相邻比特上同时引入相位误差，这是串扰（crosstalk）的典型表现。IBM Quantum 在 2022 年提出的<strong>稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad 噪声学习</strong>协议，正是针对这一缺口：它不逐门做层析，而是假设噪声生成元是<strong>局部</strong>的——只含单比特项与相邻比特的两体项——然后用精心设计的泡利旋转序列去估计每一项的率（来源：E. van den Berg, Z. Minev, A. Kandala, K. Temme, <em>Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli–Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors</em>, arXiv:2201.09866, Nature Physics 2023）。</p>\n<p>协议的核心是两步。<strong>学习</strong>：给目标门前后夹入随机泡利层，使噪声对易关系被打散，用测量结果拟合出生成元中各 Pauli 项的系数。<strong>反演</strong>：由学到的生成元构造信道的逆，用于<strong>概率性误差消除</strong>（PEC）。PEC 以略大于 1 的采样开销按权重采样「逆错误」操作，得到对可观测量的<strong>无偏估计</strong>——代价是方差随电路体积增长，而非偏差。</p>\n<p>这一方法真正改变工程实践的地方在<strong>可扩展性</strong>：参数数量随比特数与耦合图线性增长，模型能随器件一起变大，且每步学习只需短深度电路，避免了层析的指数爆炸——它是最能体现「表征—建模—缓解」闭环的案例。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[量子处理器] --&gt;|随机泡利层| B[噪声学习电路]&#10;    B --&gt; C[拟合生成元 L]&#10;    C --&gt; D[构造逆信道 L^-1]&#10;    D --&gt; E[按权重采样逆操作]&#10;    E --&gt; F[修正后的可观测量估计]&#10;    F --&gt; G[无偏但方差增大]&#10;    G --&gt; H[PEC 采样开销随体积增长]\">flowchart LR\n    A[量子处理器] --&gt;|随机泡利层| B[噪声学习电路]\n    B --&gt; C[拟合生成元 L]\n    C --&gt; D[构造逆信道 L^-1]\n    D --&gt; E[按权重采样逆操作]\n    E --&gt; F[修正后的可观测量估计]\n    F --&gt; G[无偏但方差增大]\n    G --&gt; H[PEC 采样开销随体积增长]</pre><p>需要诚实指出其边界：PEC 消除的是<strong>马尔可夫采样意义上可逆</strong>的噪声，对泄漏无能为力；且采样开销随电路体积指数增长，它适合在「略超经典可模拟规模」的区间证明量子优势，而非万能纠错替代品。真正的容错仍靠纠错码，而 PEC 学到的稀疏模型恰好可为解码器提供<strong>先验错误率</strong>——这是两个体系在 2026 年的一个自然接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表征协议族-从-rb-到-xeb\">表征协议族：从 RB 到 XEB</h2><p>同一台机器，「错误率是多少」的答案取决于用什么协议测。此处不展开度量细节（那属于硬件章节的相干时间与门保真度度量），重点是它们在<strong>建模流水线</strong>中的角色分工。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>测量对象</th>\n<th>对 SPAM 的处理</th>\n<th>对相干误差的敏感度</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RB</td>\n<td>随机基准</td>\n<td>平均门误差（每 Clifford）</td>\n<td>自动解耦</td>\n<td>低（会被打散）</td>\n<td>快速逐门筛查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穿插 RB</td>\n<td>interleaved RB</td>\n<td>单个特定门的误差</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>定位瓶颈门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GST</td>\n<td>门集层析</td>\n<td>门集的完整 PTM</td>\n<td>显式建模</td>\n<td>高（识别旋转偏差）</td>\n<td>找相干误差根因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XEB</td>\n<td>交叉熵基准</td>\n<td>纠缠门/电路级保真度</td>\n<td>统计修正</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大规模整机评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期基准</td>\n<td>cyclic benchmarking</td>\n<td>并行门与串扰</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>验证同时操作退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pauli 学习</td>\n<td>sparse PL learning</td>\n<td>生成元系数</td>\n<td>隐含</td>\n<td>中（给出相关结构）</td>\n<td>PEC 与解码器先验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这六类协议并非可互相替代，而是构成<strong>分层诊断链</strong>：先用 RB 逐比特、逐耦合器快筛（分钟级），再用 CPMG 变周期序列诊断噪声谱是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 型还是白噪声（小时级），对超标门跑 GST 找相干偏差并回炉调脉冲（天级），最后用周期基准与 XEB 在整机层面验证并行性能。注意 XEB 与 RB 的数字<strong>不可直接比较</strong>——Google 在 Willow 上的 XEB 报道值与同期 RB 值差异可达数个百分点，原因是门误差口径不同（来源：Google Quantum AI, <em>Quantum error correction below the surface code threshold</em>, Nature, 2024-12, doi:10.1038/s41586-024-08449-y）。</p>\n<p>跨团队协作的另一个陷阱是<strong>报告口径不统一</strong>：超导、离子阱、光子社区对「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」「门保真度」的定义并不一致。跨国采购或复现论文时必须确认对方报的是 XEB 还是 RB、相干时间是 echo 还是 Ramsey、误差是每门还是每 Clifford。这些度量本身的协议细节见[相干时间与门保真度度量(../1_hardware-qubit-platforms/2_coherence-fidelity-metrics.md)，脉冲级的噪声抑制手段见[控制脉冲与校准(../2_control-compilation-stack/1_control-pulse-calibration.md)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从物理噪声到解码器噪声模型\">从物理噪声到解码器噪声模型</h2><p>表征的终点是<strong>解码器</strong>。表面码等纠错码的译码器需要「综合征测量出错有多大概率」的先验——最小权重匹配（MWPM）把每次探测事件映射成时空图中的一条边，边权重直接来自物理错误率。先验偏离真实噪声，解码器就会在错误图上系统性误判，逻辑错误率随之恶化。</p>\n<p>这正是噪声模型精度直接决定容错性能的地方。Google 在 Willow（105 比特）上演示了码距 3→5→7 时逻辑错误率<strong>每加 2 个码距下降约 2.14 倍</strong>（错误抑制因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda \\approx 2.14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.14</span></span></span></span></span>），首次让逻辑错误率随码距增长而指数下降——这是「低于表面码阈值」的判据（阈值约 1%：物理错误率低于此值，加码距才有收益）。要让这条曲线成立，模型必须捕捉主导错误源：Willow 的误差预算中读出/SPAM 误差与双比特门误差共同主导，静态相位噪声相对较小——遗漏任一项，预测阈值就会偏离实测。</p>\n<p>工程实践是把表征数据「翻译」成解码器输入：每个耦合器的 Pauli 错误率来自该耦合器上并行双比特门的表征结果，读出误分类概率来自每个比特的测量基表征，二者合成时空图上的边权重与测量错误。2026 年的开源栈里这一步已相对标准化——表征产出稀疏 Pauli 模型，导出为解码器 JSON 先验，每次测量前用最新校准数据刷新权重。</p>\n<p>三个建模局限必须承认：<strong>泄漏</strong>不在两能级解码器模型内，会造成无法解释的关联事件；<strong>非马尔可夫记忆效应</strong>（如两比特间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 漂移）违反解码器的时间独立性假设，在长电路中累积预测偏差；<strong>相干误差</strong>在表征协议里常被当作随机噪声平均掉，但它短路表现为系统性旋转、长电路重新变成随机错误，危害有电路深度依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>噪声表征解决三层问题：<strong>表征</strong>（错误多大、什么形状）、<strong>建模</strong>（写成信道/生成元供下游消费）、<strong>验证</strong>（模型在真实体量下是否成立）。任一失真都会污染容错阈值计算。</li>\n<li>核心张力是<strong>保真度 vs 可扩展性</strong>：层析在 2–3 比特就指数爆炸，能上 100+ 比特的方法必然是稀疏、局部近似。</li>\n<li>三类模型各有取舍：去极化（单参数、抹平相干与 T1）、热弛豫（含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1/T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、无串扰）、稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad（含相关噪声、可逆、适合 PEC 与解码器先验）。</li>\n<li>稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad 学习＋PEC 是「表征—建模—缓解」闭环的样板：参数随比特数与耦合图线性增长，PEC 给出无偏但方差增大的估计。</li>\n<li>表征协议构成分层诊断链：RB 快筛 → CPMG 谱诊断 → GST 找相干根因 → XEB/周期基准验整机。XEB 与 RB 数字不可直接比较。</li>\n<li>噪声模型的最终消费者是<strong>解码器</strong>：其先验边权重直接来自物理错误率，先验偏离会让逻辑错误率恶化。Willow 2024 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda \\approx 2.14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.14</span></span></span></span></span> 曲线依赖误差预算的完整性。</li>\n<li>三个建模盲区需持续关注：泄漏、非马尔可夫记忆效应、被平均掉的相干误差。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"噪声模型与错误表征方法","id":"噪声模型与错误表征方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"噪声的物理来源与数学表征","id":"噪声的物理来源与数学表征"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏 Pauli-Lindblad 学习与串扰","id":"稀疏-pauli-lindblad-学习与串扰"},{"level":2,"text":"表征协议族：从 RB 到 XEB","id":"表征协议族-从-rb-到-xeb"},{"level":2,"text":"从物理噪声到解码器噪声模型","id":"从物理噪声到解码器噪声模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/control-compilation-stack/runtime-scheduling-feedback"},"next":{"title":"量子纠错码与逻辑比特","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/error-correction-fault-tolerance/qec-codes-logical-qubit"}}